@model UserGoal
<section class="hf-card"><h2>Estado do objetivo</h2><p>Pause quando precisar de espaço. Encerrar preserva todo o histórico.</p><div class="hf-lifecycle-actions">@if(Model.Status=="Active"){<form method="post" action="/goals/@Model.Id/pause">@Html.AntiForgeryToken()<button class="btn btn-outline-secondary">Pausar</button></form><form method="post" action="/goals/@Model.Id/complete">@Html.AntiForgeryToken()<button class="btn btn-success">Concluir</button></form>}else if(Model.Status=="Paused"){<form method="post" action="/goals/@Model.Id/resume">@Html.AntiForgeryToken()<button class="btn btn-success">Retomar</button></form>}@if(Model.Status is "Active" or "Paused"){<button class="btn btn-link text-danger" type="button" data-goal-dialog-open>Encerrar objetivo</button>}</div></section><dialog class="hf-goal-dialog" data-goal-dialog aria-labelledby="goal-dialog-title"><form method="dialog"><button class="btn-close" aria-label="Fechar"></button></form><h2 id="goal-dialog-title">Encerrar este objetivo?</h2><p>Seu histórico será preservado, mas o objetivo deixará de acompanhar novas conclusões.</p><div class="hf-dialog-actions"><button class="btn btn-outline-secondary" type="button" data-goal-dialog-close>Continuar com objetivo</button><form method="post" action="/goals/@Model.Id/cancel">@Html.AntiForgeryToken()<button class="btn btn-danger">Encerrar e preservar histórico</button></form></div></dialog>
